WEBVTT

00:11:29.309 --> 00:11:32.980
And if we do that,
we will have the budgets

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:36.608
that will not only lead
to gender equality,

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:38.819
which is an amazing objective in itself,

00:11:38.861 --> 00:11:44.158
but we will have better, more effective,
more efficient, more fair budgets.

00:11:44.199 --> 00:11:45.451
What's not to like?

00:11:47.578 --> 00:11:52.332
So I hope next time we meet,
maybe here again,

00:11:52.374 --> 00:11:57.671
this type of gender-responsive budgeting
will be called "budgeting."

00:11:58.630 --> 00:11:59.798
Thank you.

00:11:59.798 --> 00:12:03.844
(Applause and cheers)